          %h3#characteristic_classes_of_principal_bundles Characteristic classes of principal bundles
          %p
            This is the archetypical example: let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi H
